```
Client
  ↓
MCP (index + dispatch only)
  ↓
ODIN (routing brain)
  ↓
AEGIS (allow/deny gate)
  ↓
KRONOS (ordering + validation)
  ↓
SKADI (execution only)
  ↓
Supabase sinks
```

