# 4. GOVERNANCE RULE REWRITE

## GOLD LAW ALIGNMENT UPDATE

### GL5 (updated interpretation)

All state mutation must pass:

> ODIN → AEGIS → KRONOS → SKADI

No other path allowed.

---

### GL7 (reinforced)

No expansion of systems inside MCP.

* MCP cannot gain intelligence features
* MCP cannot embed God logic
* MCP stays flat forever

---

### GL9 (enforced upgrade)

Every action must include:

* intent
* trace_id
* routing decision (from ODIN only)
* execution log (from SKADI only)

---

# 5. ROUTING MODEL (SIMPLIFIED)

## INPUT EVENT FORMAT (unchanged externally)

```ts
{
  type,
  source,
  intent,
  payload
}
```

## ODIN OUTPUT (NEW CANONICAL CONTRACT)

```ts
{
  trace_id: string,
  intent: string,
  sink: "mnemos_memories" | "event_spine" | "decision_ledger" | "patch_proposals",
  governance_level: "strict" | "standard",
  required_gates: ["AEGIS", "KRONOS"],
  execution_mode: "write" | "read" | "propose"
}
```

