# 7. WHY THIS MATTERS (SYSTEM PRINCIPLE)

This removes:

### BEFORE

* duplicated intelligence across 3–4 layers
* inconsistent routing decisions
* SKADI + MCP overlap
* governance drift risk

### AFTER

* ONE brain (ODIN)
* ONE gate (AEGIS)
* ONE executor (SKADI)
* ONE surface (MCP)

